[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2922664215","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106928#issuecomment-2922664215","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106928","id":2922664215,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uNFEX","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-30T15:12:04Z","updated_at":"2025-05-30T15:33:27Z","body":"You seem to be missing copy and (I guess more importantly) move assignment operators.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2922664215/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2922852192","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106928#issuecomment-2922852192","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106928","id":2922852192,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uNy9g","user":{"login":"allhailcheese","id":37654973,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NjU0OTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37654973?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allhailcheese","html_url":"https://github.com/allhailcheese","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allhailcheese/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allhailcheese/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allhailcheese/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allhailcheese/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allhailcheese/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allhailcheese/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allhailcheese/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allhailcheese/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allhailcheese/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-30T16:34:55Z","updated_at":"2025-05-30T16:34:55Z","body":"> You seem to be missing copy and (I guess more importantly) move assignment operators.\r\n\r\nthey are not:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9a96765d-35bd-44b6-ae01-a73d61377519)\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2922852192/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2922997519","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106928#issuecomment-2922997519","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106928","id":2922997519,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uOWcP","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-30T17:39:20Z","updated_at":"2025-05-30T18:16:35Z","body":"Those are copy/move constructors, not assignment operators.\r\n\r\nBy not declaring any assignment operators you will end up relying on the compiler-generated ones for any assignment, and per the \"rule of five\" the compiler will not generate any move assignment operator (or move constructor) if there is a destructor, copy constructor, or copy assignment operator defined.\r\n\r\nSo this class currently does not satisfy `std::is_move_assignable`.\r\n\r\nEDIT: It seems the copy assignment operator is inadvertently deleted as well, which I'm realizing now is inherited from the `T[]` member, so this isn't `std::is_copy_assignable` either.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2922997519/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2923399525","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106928#issuecomment-2923399525","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106928","id":2923399525,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uP4ll","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-30T20:18:54Z","updated_at":"2025-05-30T20:18:54Z","body":"Are there any places in the engine that would benefit from this right now? I think it is important that we maintain our problem-first driven mentality see https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/best_practices_for_engine_contributors.html#the-problem-always-comes-first\r\n\r\nAdditionally, I'm a bit apprehensive of adding so many new types so quickly especially since our core types are still mostly undocumented. Having more types without a clear use case will only make the situation worse","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2923399525/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2925137968","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106928#issuecomment-2925137968","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106928","id":2925137968,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uWhAw","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-31T12:38:30Z","updated_at":"2025-05-31T12:40:15Z","body":"> Are there any places in the engine that would benefit from this right now? I think it is important that we maintain our problem-first driven mentality see https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/best_practices_for_engine_contributors.html#the-problem-always-comes-first\r\n\r\nNo (aside from an [open pull request](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106595) that may make use of it).\r\nI think the chances of us needing a fixed array type are 100% long term. It came up in a core meeting, and we decided we may as well implement it. \r\nThat said, I don't mind waiting to merge this until there's a true need.\r\n\r\n> Additionally, I'm a bit apprehensive of adding so many new types so quickly especially since our core types are still mostly undocumented. \r\n\r\nPerhaps you missed this, but we have [recently merged](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs/pull/10873) a (minimal) overview over our C++ types, courtesy of @calinou :) https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/cpp_usage_guidelines.html\r\n\r\nWe should definitely expand our documentation though. There's tons of containers in our codebase that don't even have a comment on the type.\r\n\r\n> Having more types without a clear use case will only make the situation worse\r\n\r\nIt's not all downhill luckily :)\r\nWe recently [removed `VMap`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100446), and I've been trying to consolidate our [hashing containers](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12515). And there's the [harmonization efforts](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104286) as well.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2925137968/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2925407013","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106928#issuecomment-2925407013","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106928","id":2925407013,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uXisl","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-31T16:28:09Z","updated_at":"2025-05-31T16:28:34Z","body":"> You seem to be missing copy and (I guess more importantly) move assignment operators.\r\n\r\nI fixed it on my end. But you made me re-examine auto-generated move and copy semantics on `FixedVector` too. Looks like auto generated functions have been faulty, I made a fix: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106997\r\n\r\n@clayjohn We also don't have users for `FixedVector` yet. Maybe we should have waited to merge it until we have a concrete need? \r\nI searched the 3.x codebase, and there are a few users of its equivalent [`FixedArray`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/3.x/core/fixed_array.h), but not many.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2925407013/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2925444821","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106928#issuecomment-2925444821","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106928","id":2925444821,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uXr7V","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-31T17:07:36Z","updated_at":"2025-05-31T17:07:36Z","body":"> We also don't have users for FixedVector yet. Maybe we should have waited to merge it until we have a concrete need\r\n\r\nYes, I think we should have. ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2925444821/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2947183260","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106928#issuecomment-2947183260","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106928","id":2947183260,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6vqnKc","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-06T00:18:07Z","updated_at":"2025-06-06T00:18:07Z","body":"Putting this into draft until it's needed.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2947183260/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]